flowchart TD
    A[Set a baseline once, per bike] --> B[Adjust from baseline for a specific ride]
    B --> C[Ride]
    C --> D[Log a ride note: what changed, plus Grip, Feel, and Control ratings]
    D --> E[Ride note saved as history against that baseline]
    E --> F[Next time, check history before adjusting again]
    F --> B
